  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A parallel plate capacitor whose capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pF</mi></math> is charged by a battery to a potential difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> between its plates. The charging battery is now disconnected and a porcelain plate with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is inserted between the plates, then the plate would oscillate back and forth between the plates with a constant mechanical energy of _______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pJ</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>(Assume no friction)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "864",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pJ</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1008</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pJ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1008</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mi>pJ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pJ</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Mechanical energy<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>U</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1008</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>864</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pJ</mi></math></p>",
